OL,3,GNEWSAFirst locally trained health
OL,4,Astudents graduate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first cohort of healthcare students
OL,7,Fwho trained while working for an
OL,8,Fisland's health department have
OL,9,Fgraduated.
OL,11,FNearly 60 students in Jersey have
OL,12,Fqualified in a range of roles, such as
OL,13,Fmental health nursing, midwifery and
OL,14,Fradiology, at academic levels from
OL,15,Fapprenticeships to masters degrees.
OL,17,FThe health minister said training
OL,18,Fhealthcare staff in the island would
OL,19,Fbuild a "skilled and resilient
OL,20,Fworkforce for the future".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
