OL,3,GNEWSAFirst locally trained health
OL,4,Astudents graduate
OL,5,
OL,6,FHazel McWhinnie, the dean of nursing,
OL,7,Fmidwifery and allied health
OL,8,Fprofessional education, said the number
OL,9,Fof different roles students had
OL,10,Fqualified in was "quite tremendous" for
OL,11,F"such a small island".
